sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Short voice input — transcription never advances the route
  actor Walker as Walker
  participant Phone as Phone / MediaRecorder
  participant API as Cloud Run transcription endpoint
  participant Vertex as Vertex AI
  participant Route as Existing observations + route engine

  Walker->>Phone: Tap “Say a sentence” after disclosure
  Note over Walker,Phone: Stop playback before capture.<br/>No recording during crossings.
  Phone->>Phone: Record for up to 15 seconds
  Walker->>Phone: Stop (or cancel)
  Note over Walker,Phone: Release microphone tracks.<br/>Cancel or language change<br/>drops late results.
  Phone->>API: Binary audio, at most 2 MiB
  Note over API,Vertex: 8s upload, 5s decode.<br/>28s request, usage limits.<br/>2 MiB upload, 16s audio.<br/>No raw audio saved.
  API->>Vertex: In-memory WAV, transcription only
  Vertex-->>API: Validated text (at most 500 characters)
  API-->>Phone: Unconfirmed transcript
  Note over Phone,Route: Checkpoint and route action have not changed.
  Phone-->>Walker: Editable text, waiting for explicit Send
  Walker->>Phone: Edit, then press Send
  Phone->>Route: Existing text observation, once
  Route-->>Phone: Validated next step / question / recovery
  Note over Phone,Route: Fixed accepted playback follows the validated action.<br/>No dynamically generated navigation speech.
